<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on EMS-Chemie.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on EMS-Chemie.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland says it has issued a total of three million American-style call warrants, on EMS-Chemie bearer shares.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    4650.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	12.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.40 SFR		  GEARING	8.50 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.OCT.96-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	14.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  4610.00 SFR</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  UIYY</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
